**[P3]** Update the stale reference at line 195 too.

The `dropUnreferencedVariants` comment says: "After truncateAtFullPopulationAllocation has pruned unreachable allocations". No function has that name. `eliminateDeadBranches` does the pruning, and after this PR it stops only at an ordinary full-population allocation.

<details>
<summary><b>Suggested text</b></summary>

```go
// dropUnreferencedVariants removes entries from flag.Variations that are not
// referenced by any split in any allocation. After eliminateDeadBranches has
// pruned unreachable allocations, their variants would otherwise remain in
// the payload for no reason.
```

